{
  "_comment": [
    "ALLOWLIST, not a denylist — fail-closed by design (see",
    "docs/proposals/config-only-deploy/context.md and",
    "services/reality-flow-authentication/infra/config-only-allowed-params.json for the",
    "full rationale). A parameter not named here is unsafe-by-default.",
    "",
    "Deliberately NOT listed, and why:",
    "  ServiceName, Env             — identity of the stack itself.",
    "  LambdaPackagesBucketName     — bucket identity.",
    "  LambdaCodeS3Key              — a fixed, never-timestamped key here",
    "                                 (${ServiceName}/function.zip, same as",
    "                                 reality-flow-authentication) — excluded",
    "                                 on principle even though it never",
    "                                 actually differs.",
    "  OAuthCodesTableName          — the PHYSICAL resource names of the",
    "  OAuthConnectionsTableName      DynamoDB tables this template itself",
    "                                 creates (TableName: !Ref ...) — changing",
    "                                 either makes CloudFormation try to",
    "                                 REPLACE that table (data loss).",
    "  McpApiDomainName, McpApiBasePath, EnableCustomDomainMapping",
    "                               — create/replace/delete this stack's",
    "                                 BasePathMapping and change the public",
    "                                 URL / OAuth issuer — topology, full deploy.",
    "  (CrmApi*/AuthService* DomainName+BasePath and EnableBasePathStrip ARE",
    "   allowed: plain Lambda env vars read at runtime.)"
  ],
  "allowedParams": [
    "LambdaMemorySize",
    "LambdaTimeout",
    "LogRetentionInDays",
    "JWTSecret",
    "JWTRefreshSecret",
    "CrmApiDomainName",
    "CrmApiBasePath",
    "CrmApiInternalKey",
    "AuthServiceDomainName",
    "AuthServiceBasePath",
    "EnableBasePathStrip",
    "AllowedOrigins",
    "FrontendUrl"
  ]
}
